  "discussions_data": [
    {
      "id": "1a7b600279585989c167171162951be63f2c1899",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 681180925,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I can't reproduce this on macOS 11.5.2 with Xcode 12.5.1, CMake 3.19.7, and ninja 1.10.2, using `cmake -G Ninja -DENABLE_LUA=OFF`.\n\n1. On what version of what OS are you doing this?\n1. Are you doing it from the command line or in some IDE?\n1. For what generator is CMake generating build files?\n1. What is the build error?",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-09-18T10:11:56.682Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-09-18T10:11:56.682Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 117407943,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 4227,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "52d634a608005af41efef0220d5da6fd312f298e",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 681190952,
          "type": null,
          "body": "This shouldn't be an issue in the first place, as HAVE_LUA and LUA_FOUND are only true if ENABLE_LUA has been set. So your change is somewhat redundant. Could you try to reproduce with a clean build directory or by deleting CMakeCache.txt before trying again? Also, sometimes on Linux systems the lookup may be incomplete, if multiple versions of LUA have been installed. Please ensure, only 5.1 or 5.2 is present, we are not compatible with 5.3 or higher",
          "author": {
            "id": 2498449,
            "username": "rknall",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Roland Knall",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9e1d973c5007651b2ca47071f80324c2de5349d873e365cf0761df5542dfe382?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/rknall"
